  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nLast week we held our weekly triage call (https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/12206) and the meeting notes will be posted there shortly. The next one is scheduled for March 12, 2026, at 9AM PDT. Note that this is 1 week later in the Americas-EMEA friendly time.\n\n**PLEASE ALSO NOTE THAT DUE TO THE TIME OF YEAR, THIS WILL BE ONE HOUR EARLIER FOR EUROPEAN PARTICIPANTS!**\n\nPeople interested in attending the next call who need the invite please respond here or reach out privately to @cwilso, or the editors. Please tag issues and PRs for the next call using agenda+ in all WHATWG repositories across [issues](https://github.com/search?q=org%3Awhatwg+is%3Aopen+label%3Aagenda%2B&type=issues) and [pull requests](https://github.com/search?q=org%3Awhatwg+is%3Aopen+label%3Aagenda%2B&type=pullrequests) and we would like to invite anyone that can contribute to join us.",
